<title>UK: Skyepharma 17-mth pretax loss 14.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Skyepharma 17-mth pretax loss 14.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>17 months to December 31, 1996. Comparison is with year to July 31, 1995.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss per shr (pence)    6.9		    vs 13.8</p>
<p> Pretax loss		 14.615		 vs 9.981</p>
<p> Research and devt costs 2.098		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		    11.08		  vs 7.59</p>
<p> Net cash (end 96)	 19.3		   vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British-based pharmaceuticals company is SkyePharma Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
